{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a DEMO version of Overgrown Cleaner. It includes the first level from the game which will become player's workshop. It shows the basic game mechanics: tool crafting, lawn mowing, cutting bushes &amp; selling treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Trim the bushes &amp; craft your toys!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally bought the land you\u2019ve been saving for. Now it\u2019s time to build your dream workshop and grow your gardening business \u2014 but since you\u2019re broke, you\u2019ll need to craft tools from whatever you can find. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft and customize powerful tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/9875be9ddc247ba91ec70cecb4737323.poster.avif?t=1760108321\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/9875be9ddc247ba91ec70cecb4737323.webm?t=1760108321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/9875be9ddc247ba91ec70cecb4737323.mp4?t=1760108321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seemingly useless finds can turn out to be incredibly useful! Discover your inner craftsman, create unique gardening tools that will outshine all commercial gardening equipment with their power and functionality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect valuable treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/c65279adee56d242662e51dee4a79bee.poster.avif?t=1760108321\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/c65279adee56d242662e51dee4a79bee.webm?t=1760108321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/c65279adee56d242662e51dee4a79bee.mp4?t=1760108321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you make your way through the dense greenery, keep a sharp eye out\u2014you might come across valuable discoveries that will help fund the expansion of your workshop. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover abandoned locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/9d2be37298ec974219db75fccb963720.poster.avif?t=1760108321\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/9d2be37298ec974219db75fccb963720.webm?t=1760108321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/extras/9d2be37298ec974219db75fccb963720.mp4?t=1760108321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten gardens are just the beginning. With the experience you gain and the variety of tools at your disposal, you'll gain access to diverse and unique locations such as skateparks, playgrounds, or military training grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094290?t=1760108321","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094290/de3004d3a28017cebb1e32d06956acba939b0bd3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760108321","capsule_image":"https://sha